  "caption": "Annual precipitation, evaporation and net precipitation responses across AMOC recovery groups. Columns show changes in precipitation(P), upward-positive evaporation(E, including sublimation and evapotranspiration), and net precipitation(P−E), in mmday−1. Rows show recovery(GFDL-ESM4, NorESM2-LM, CAS-ESM2-0), non-recovery(CESM2, CNRM-ESM2-1, UKESM1-0-LL), and non-recovery minus recovery. Each group is an equal-weight mean of three models. Changes are experiment years271–280 minus1–10, with CF time-duration weighting and periodic bilinear interpolation to2degrees. Dots indicate unanimous three-model sign agreement in group responses, or group differences passing the centred two-sided circular block bootstrap(9999resamples; largest p over2,3,4year blocks) and fieldwise Benjamini–Hochberg FDR atq<0.05. Cross-hatching indicates failure of the applicable criterion. No significance interpretation of sign agreement as a p-value test is implied.",
